The mosque dataset in this directory (mosques.tsv and mosques.meta.json) combines two
sources, and is made available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

- OpenStreetMap (ids n…, w… and r…: its nodes, ways and relations):
  © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0 — https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
- Overture Maps Foundation's places (ids o…: Overture's ids without their dashes):
  Community Data License Agreement – Permissive 2.0, whose text follows below —
  https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/

How it is made: scripts/mosque-data (build.sh, overture.py, build.mjs) and the workflow
.github/workflows/mosque-data.yml, which rebuilds it every week from Geofabrik's
extract of Indonesia (https://download.geofabrik.de/asia/indonesia.html) and Overture's
latest release of places (https://docs.overturemaps.org/guides/places/).

Data masjid di direktori ini berasal dari OpenStreetMap (ODbL 1.0) dan Overture Maps
Foundation (CDLA-Permissive-2.0), dan tersedia dengan lisensi ODbL 1.0.

